<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's reserves rise to 1.552 bln dinars Aug 31.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's reserves rise to 1.552 bln dinars Aug 31.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's total foreign exchange reserves rose by 174 million dinars to 1.552 billion at August 31, compared to 1.378 billion on July 31, Central Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>    Details (rounded)    August 31    July 31    Dec 31,1995</p>
<p>Assets (Dinar millions)</p>
<p>    Gold and Foreign     1,524	  1,347	1,530</p>
<p>    SDRs			  28	     31	   12</p>
<p>($=0.98 dinar)</p>
</text>
